<dc:title>Glenna Goodacre</dc:title>
<dc:description>&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Glenna Goodacre is the designer and sculptor of the &lt;a href=&quot;http://mallhistory.org/items/show/65&quot;&gt;Vietnam Women&#039;s Memorial,&lt;/a&gt; dedicated in November 1993. Goodacre wanted the memorial&#039;s figures to show despair, dedication, and hope of the nurses and servicewomen serving in Vietnam.&lt;/p&gt;</dc:description>
